NegroniMetal change to ios-flame 745c434 phone/metal2 (on top of flame/0001-0005), applied by scripts/metal/fetch-sources.sh:
resource retention for the asynchronous path (no NEGRONIMETAL_SYNC / NEGRONIMETAL_DEFER_SCHEDULED wait).
- useResource:usage:(stages:), useResources:count:usage:(stages:), useHeap:(stages:), useHeaps:count:(stages:) add the
  objects to the command buffer's resourceOwners (as setBuffer/setTexture do), so a no-copy buffer (CoreAnimation's) is
  not deallocated and its pages unmapped while its GPU work is in flight. Before this they were no-ops or missing.
- -[NBBuffer dealloc] counts no-copy deallocations while command buffers are in flight, and those a runtime command
  buffer still uses (NBLOG for the first 8). Telemetry row "J nocopy-dealloc inflight=.. used=.. | hostinv n=.. r=.. kb=..",
  hostinv = m2v's host-import invalidations (m2v/0002, m2v_negroni_host_invalidate_stat).

